window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Best-selling author Harley Humbug needs an escape.</p> <p>From the current state of her own love life.</p> <p>From her deadline she blew past weeks ago.</p> <p>From Christmas, which is just around the corner, and the bad luck it usually brings with it.</p> <p>When a snowstorm causes a road closure, she chalks it up to one more thing to go wrong.</p> <p>Little does she know the detour will take her to a town she never knew existed and right into the path - and possible arms - of a man who might just be her real-life muse.</p>"; 
